<p>
	This app appliance includes Collabora Online Development Edition and Nextcloud.
</p>
<ul>
	<li>
		Please make sure you access UCS and Nextcloud via https://&lt;hostname&gt;.&lt;ucs-domain&gt; and not with the IP address.
	</li>
	<li>
		Please accept an exception for the UCS SSL certificate.
	</li>
	<li>
		The communication between Nextcloud and Collabora uses hostnames. If the above 	&lt;hostname&gt;.&lt;ucs-domain&gt; combination does not work for your client, you can either add the UCS system to your client's list of DNS nameservers or you can add the IP address and the hostname to your local hosts file.
	</li>
</ul>
<p>
	For a login as admin user, please user the username &quot;Administrator&quot; and the password given during the setup.
</p>
<p>
	To use Nextcloud, users have to be enable for it first. Login to the UCS management system, select or create a respective user and enable the Nextcloud checkbox.
</p>
